<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶらバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There stood one man, clad in a Noh mask and a red cloth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that bizarre sight, I covered my mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, I'm sorry for startling you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'd just like to ask the way..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yes...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Which way should I go to reach the Emperor's castle?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, well, um..."</STYLE><PG>
Despite the gentle manner of the <STYLE ID="1">man</STYLE>'s words and actions, I could not let down my guard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="1">the man</STYLE> noticed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In one smooth motion, he took off the Noh mask.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I saw his face, I caught my breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">The gentleman</STYLE> had blue eyes and brown hair, just like a Westerner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right before my eyes was a Westerner, someone I had never before been able to come anywhere near.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think such fine looks had been hidden beneath the Noh mask.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh, the Emperor's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"U-um...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'll show you the way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, there's no need for that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't put you to such trouble..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-no, you see, I'm </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>reeeeeally </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>free right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>　Reeeeeally!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A short silence took its seat between the two of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But,<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hahahaha! So you were!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">the gentleman</STYLE> burst into loud laughter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, I'm sorry. I never expected anyone to insist that hard on being free. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ahahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Heh heh heh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing his smile, I was finally able to relax as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, may I ask you to show me the way? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="にいむらあきら">Ko Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the gentleman named <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="あきら">Ko</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-sama</STYLE> held out his right hand to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
What could he mean by it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could this be a Western greeting?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed his lead and held out my right hand in the same way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> took my hand and shook it up and down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Pleased to meet you. What is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, my name is </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm 16."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Um, and your surname...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh... my family are merchants, so we have no surname..."</STYLE><PG>
Townsfolk like us were not officially permitted surnames.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I did not know my own surname.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No surname...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What does that mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you from the West after all?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If so, perhaps you are not aware that there is such a law."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, no, I'm Japanese. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I only look like this because there's a Westerner among my ancestors. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But my home village is in a remote region far from here, so I don't know much about Tokyo."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"A Westerner among your ancestors...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Among my ancestors is a Westerner who came here about 400 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh my! No wonder... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But why have you come all the way to Tokyo?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's a long story, so shall we talk as we walk?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was not very far from here to the Emperor's castle.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
